Conflicts: rpmini-dev
Replaces: rpmini-dev
Description: hako development environment
 Tools and settings for the development image: ssh, gdbserver, GPU / input /
 audio test tools, SDL3, screenshots (grim), a root shell on the USB serial
 console (ttyGS0) and the
 /data/dev/session.env override of the session. Not for release images.
